@startuml
title Graderate State Transition Diagram

state "Waiting" as Waiting
state Active
state Expired
state Archived

[*] --> Waiting

' Transitions from Waiting
Waiting --> Active : start date arrived

' Transitions from Active
Active --> Active : current date < finish date
Active --> Expired : current date >= finish date

' Transitions from Expired
Expired --> Expired : after 1 year since expiration
Expired --> Archived : after 1 year since expiration

Archived --> [*]

@enduml
